OL,3,GNEWSAMan jailed day after abusing 999
OL,4,Acall handlers
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who repeatedly called 999 and
OL,7,Fabused the call handlers has been
OL,8,Fjailed just a day after his arrest.
OL,10,FLazarus Willmott, 59, of Great Brays in
OL,11,FHarlow, Essex, made six calls to 999
OL,12,Fwhere he was abusive to the handler and
OL,13,Fwished harm on officers between 07:40
OL,14,Fand 08:06 BST on Sunday.
OL,16,FHe was arrested at his home a short
OL,17,Ftime later and while in custody, he
OL,18,Fracially abused one of Essex Police's
OL,19,Fofficers.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
