OL,3,GNEWSAMan jailed day after abusing 999
OL,4,Acall handlers
OL,5,
OL,6,FOn Monday, he pleaded guilty to the
OL,7,Foffences at Chelmsford Magistrates'
OL,8,FCourt and was sentenced to six weeks in
OL,9,Fprison.
